sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Row locking prevents double consumption
    accDescr: Bob waits while Alice holds the batch lock. After Alice commits a 7 kilogram deduction, Bob sees 3 kilograms and rolls back.
    participant A as Alice
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant B as Bob
    A->>DB: Lock batch
    DB-->>A: 10 kg available
    B->>DB: Request same lock
    Note over DB,B: Bob waits for Alice
    A->>DB: Deduct 7 kg + write ledger
    A->>DB: Commit and release lock
    DB-->>B: Lock granted: 3 kg remain
    Note over B: Needs 7 kg
    B->>DB: Roll back
